{"ex-3A03-1":{"id":"ex-3A03-1","chapter":"3A03","number":1,"title":"凸透鏡成像 (I)","question":"<p>如圖所示，物體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 置於一塊凸透鏡前，來自 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點的三條光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 射向透鏡，透鏡的焦點是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span>′。</p><p>(a) 完成光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的路徑，從而找出像 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>′<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>′ 的位置。像距是多少？</p><p>(b) 據此，完成光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的路徑。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/b3a01a0fd6a3f061d616642c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:316.7px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a)</p><p>像距是 15 cm。</p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/7667e10399f6377e2d56033c.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:316.7px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/2a524d7f137b9e6c66af8ed1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:316.7px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>光線 q 不屬於作圖規則中的光線。然而，由於它來自 A，必定通過 A′。同樣，來自 B 的光線必定通過 B′。</p>","think":"<p>把凸透鏡換成焦距為 15 cm 的凸透鏡。假設物體與透鏡的位置不變，找出物體的新像的位置。</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>圖中物距為 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，物高為 10 cm。當 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>，物體現在位於 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>。由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> 及 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>，得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>。</p><p>新的像是倒立、與物體等大的實像。把 B′ 放在透鏡右方 30 cm 的主軸上，把 A′ 放在 B′ 下方 10 cm 處。由 A 發出、平行於主軸的光線，折射後通過右方的新焦點；通過光心的光線則繼續直行。兩條光線的交點確定 A′ 的位置。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":14,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.333983398437454,560.2833009033203,328.81626892089844],"text":"例 題 1 凸透鏡成像 (I)\r\n如圖所示，物體 AB 置於一塊凸透鏡前，來自 A 點的三條光線 p、q\r\n和 r 射向透鏡，透鏡的焦點是 F 和 F′。\r\nF′\r\nA p\r\nq\r\nr\r\nB F\r\n5 cm\r\n(a) 完成光線 p 和 r 的路徑，從而找出像 A′B′ 的位置。像距是多少？\r\n(b) 據此，完成光線 q 的路徑。\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,328.81626892089844,560.2833009033203,670.2179833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) \r\nF′\r\nB′\r\nA′\r\nA p\r\nq\r\nr\r\nB F\r\n5 cm\r\n像距是 15 cm。\r\n(b) \r\nF′\r\nB′\r\nA′\r\nA p\r\nq\r\nr\r\nB F\r\n5 cm\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.333983398437454,179.2833009033203,670.2179833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n光線 q 並不是成像規則提\r\n及的光線，但由於它來自 A\r\n點，因此必定會穿過 A′ 點。\r\n同樣，來自 B 點的光線也\r\n必定會穿過 B′ 點。\r\n! 這條例題強調縱使來自\r\n物體的光線方向與成像規則\r\n不同，通過透鏡後仍會通過\r\n像，或看似來自像 I。\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"answer","box":[180.48300090332032,659.9561767984375,563.4830009033203,748.6181767984375],"text":"想一想\r\n現以另一塊焦距為 15 cm 的凸透鏡取代原來的透鏡。假設物體和透鏡\r\n的位置不變，找出這次物體的像會在哪裏出現。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","englishAlignedFields":["thinkAnswer","tips","think"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-2":{"id":"ex-3A03-2","chapter":"3A03","number":2,"title":"凸透鏡成像 (II)","question":"<p>如圖所示，物體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 置於一塊凸透鏡前，來自 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> 射向透鏡，透鏡的焦點是 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span>′。試繪畫出射線和像。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/c4035a9c5a7c075544b86d6e.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:440.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/13238441808ac61a5aff1319.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:510.1px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>① 根據作圖規則完成光線 p 和 r。② 把 ① 的光線向後延長，確定像 A′B′ 的位置。③ 由於光線 q 來自 A，通過透鏡後便像從 A′ 發出。④ 由於光線 s 來自 B，通過透鏡後便像從 B′ 發出。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":15,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,281.97398376464844],"text":"例 題 2 凸透鏡成像 (II)\r\n如圖所示，物體 AB 置於一塊凸透鏡前，來自 AB 的光線 p、q、r 和 s\r\n射向透鏡，透鏡的焦點是 F 和 F′。試繪畫出射線和像。\r\nF′\r\np\r\nq\r\ns\r\nB F\r\nA\r\nr\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,281.97398376464844,565.2833009033203,518.9729833984375],"text":"題 解\r\nF′\r\nA′\r\nB′\r\np\r\nq\r\ns\r\nB F\r\nA\r\n②\r\n③ ①\r\n④\r\nr\r\n①\r\n! 可強調像與物體\r\n上各點一一對應。\r\n"},{"page":15,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,184.2833009033203,518.9729833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n① 根據成像規則，完成光\r\n線 p 和 r 的路徑。\r\n② 把 步 驟 ① 的光線向後\r\n延長，找出像 A′B′ 的位\r\n置。\r\n③ 由於光線 q 來自 A 點，\r\n因此它通過透鏡後看似\r\n來自 A′ 點。\r\n④ 由於光線 s 來自 B 點，\r\n因此它通過透鏡後看似\r\n來自 B′ 點。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-3":{"id":"ex-3A03-3","chapter":"3A03","number":3,"title":"通過凸透鏡的平行光線","question":"<p>如圖所示，平行光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 射向一塊凸透鏡。試繪畫出射線。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/80069c03ae411069005e78d7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:256.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/80bbfdda1ad3f8bf24a03c53.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:254.5px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>① 根據規則 3，q 繼續直行。② 畫出焦平面。③ 由於 p 和 q 在通過透鏡前互相平行，它們必定在焦平面上相交。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":17,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,229.34397888183594],"text":"例 題 3 通過凸透鏡的平行光線\r\n如圖所示，平行光線 p 和 q 射向一塊凸透鏡。試繪畫出射線。\r\np\r\nq\r\nF′ F\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,229.34397888183594,565.2833009033203,364.3829833984375],"text":"題 解\r\np\r\nq\r\nF′ F\r\n②\r\n①\r\n③\r\n"},{"page":17,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,184.2833009033203,364.3829833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n① 根據成像規則3，光線 q\r\n不會偏折。\r\n② 畫出焦平面。\r\n③ 因為光線 p 和 q 在通過\r\n透鏡前是平行的，因此\r\n它們必定會在焦平面相\r\n交。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-4":{"id":"ex-3A03-4","chapter":"3A03","number":4,"title":"凸透鏡成像的放大率","question":"<p>某物體高 5 cm，置於凸透鏡前 15 cm 處。凸透鏡的焦距是 10 cm。</p><p>(a) 求像的位置和放大率。</p><p>(b) 當物體逐漸移離 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span>′，放大率會怎樣改變？</p>","answer":"<p>(a)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/65687872228de565a0b952ef.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:341.9px\"></p><p>像距 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></math></p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/34b88103dd21a44b2cfc15e1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:343.5px\"></p><p>放大率減小。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":21,"kind":"question","box":[54.83430090332031,56.33398339843757,565.2833009033203,185.6499481201172],"text":"例 題 4 凸透鏡成像的放大率\r\n某物體高 5 cm，置於凸透鏡前 15 cm 處。凸透鏡的焦距是 10 cm。\r\n(a) 求像的位置和放大率。\r\n(b) 當物體逐漸移離 F′，放大率會怎樣改變？\r\n"},{"page":21,"kind":"answer","box":[54.83430090332031,185.6499481201172,565.2833009033203,425.6019833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) (b)\r\nO F′ F\r\nI\r\n5 cm\r\n5 cm\r\nO F′ F\r\nI′ I\r\nO\r\n即使物體移離 ，這條\r\n出射線也保持不變\r\nF′\r\n像距 v = 30 cm 放大率會減小。\r\nm = v\r\nu\r\n = 30\r\n15 = 2\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-5":{"id":"ex-3A03-5","chapter":"3A03","number":5,"title":"凹透鏡成像","question":"<p>如圖所示，物體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 置於一塊凹透鏡前，來自物體的光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span>、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> 射向透鏡。</p><p>p</p><p>q A</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mtext>′</mtext><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{F′ r}{B F}</annotation></semantics></math></span> s</p><p>(a) 完成光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的路徑，從而找出像 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>′<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>′ 的位置。</p><p>(b) 據此，完成光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的路徑。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/5720c5b696053242e7a5e5ac.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:317.8px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a)</p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/d0bb9294bb844ed7919ca174.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:323.7px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/49dc9f27a9134b264ad86e79.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:506.6px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"<p>如果把透鏡換成焦距較長的另一透鏡，像距會如何改變？</p>","thinkAnswer":"<p>對凹透鏡而言，較長焦距表示 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>|</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>|</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 的大小較大。物距 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 固定時，由 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> 得 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>v</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>=</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>u</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>+</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>F</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math>。因此像距的大小增加：虛像在物體一側移離透鏡、靠近物體。帶正負號的像距變得更負。</p>","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":26,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,342.8063507080078],"text":"例 題 5 凹透鏡成像\r\n如圖所示，物體 AB 置於一塊凹透鏡前，來自物體的光線 p、q、r 和 s\r\n射向透鏡。\r\nF′\r\nF\r\nA\r\nB\r\nr\r\nq\r\np\r\ns\r\n(a) 完成光線 q 和 r 的路徑，從而找出像 A′B′ 的位置。\r\n(b) 據此，完成光線 p 和 s 的路徑。\r\n"},{"page":26,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,342.8063507080078,560.2833009033203,692.9459833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) \r\nF′ A′\r\nB′ F\r\nA\r\nB\r\nr\r\ns\r\nq\r\np\r\n(b)\r\nF′ A′\r\nB′ F\r\nA\r\nB\r\ns\r\np\r\n! 可強調像與物體上\r\n各點一一對應。\r\n"},{"page":26,"kind":"answer","box":[180.28300480332032,676.9463805984375,563.2830048033203,749.5763805984375],"text":"想一想\r\n如果改用一塊焦距較長的凹透鏡，像距會怎樣改變？\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":"Complete Chinese translation of the English supplementary answer","sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","think","thinkAnswer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-6":{"id":"ex-3A03-6","chapter":"3A03","number":6,"title":"通過凹透鏡的平行光線","question":"<p>如圖所示，平行光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> 和 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span> 射向一塊凹透鏡。試繪畫出射線。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/b7acfdaedc74f4496d93ebed.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:259.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/30b80170e54eb9ce5e0ad7d7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:259.1px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>① 根據規則 3，q 繼續直行。② 畫出焦平面。③ 由於 p 和 q 在通過透鏡前互相平行，通過透鏡後，它們像從焦平面上的同一點發出。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":28,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,237.6714324951172],"text":"例 題 6 通過凹透鏡的平行光線\r\n如圖所示，平行光線 p 和 q 射向一塊凹透鏡。試繪畫出射線。\r\nq\r\np\r\nF′ F\r\n"},{"page":28,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,237.6714324951172,560.2833009033203,383.4739833984375],"text":"題 解\r\nq\r\np\r\nF′ F\r\n② ①\r\n③\r\n"},{"page":28,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,179.2833009033203,383.4739833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n① 根據成像規則3，光線 q\r\n不會偏折。\r\n② 畫出焦平面。\r\n③ 由於光線 p 和 q 在通過\r\n透鏡前是平行的，因此\r\n它們通過透鏡後會看似\r\n來自焦平面上的同一點。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-7":{"id":"ex-3A03-7","chapter":"3A03","number":7,"title":"凹透鏡成像的放大率","question":"<p>右圖顯示通過焦距為 2 m 的透鏡所看到的景象。透鏡與椅子相距 2 m。</p><p>(a) 寫出像的性質。</p><p>(b) 繪畫光線圖以找出椅子的像在哪處出現。</p><p>(c) 求像的放大率。</p><p>(d) 如果把透鏡移近椅子，像的放大率會怎樣改變？</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/3d4f5a3fcb87824b0f19effe.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:315.1px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 像是正立和縮小的虛像。</p><p>(b)</p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>v</mi><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{v}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 0.5</p><p>(d)</p><p>像會變大，因此放大率會增加。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/15c1b664f9aa4df3d558a8bc.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:270.0px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/85fa182a13452a04c90e8bad.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:272.2px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":31,"kind":"question","box":[188.4833009033203,56.33398339843757,565.4833009033202,283.6500701904297],"text":"例 題 7 凹透鏡成像的放大率\r\n右圖顯示通過焦距為 2 m\r\n的透鏡所看到的景象。透\r\n鏡與椅子相距 2 m。\r\n(a) 寫出像的性質。\r\n(b) 繪畫光線圖以找出椅子\r\n的像在哪處出現。\r\n(c) 求像的放大率。\r\n(d) 如果把透鏡移近椅子，像的放大率會怎樣改變？\r\n"},{"page":31,"kind":"answer","box":[188.4833009033203,283.6500701904297,565.4833009033202,696.1869833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 像是正立和縮小的虛像。\r\n(b) \r\nF′\r\nI\r\nO\r\n0.5 m\r\n(c) m = v\r\nu\r\n = 1\r\n2 = 0.5\r\n(d) \r\nF′\r\nI\r\nO\r\n0.5 m\r\n即使 u 減小，這條光線也保持不變\r\nI′\r\nO\r\n像會變大，因此放大率會增加。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-8":{"id":"ex-3A03-8","chapter":"3A03","number":8,"title":"以一條光線找出像和焦點的位置","question":"<p>在圖 a 中，光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> 通過焦距為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的透鏡 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 後折射。</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是放在透鏡主軸上的一個點物體。</p><p>s</p><p>(a) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是哪種透鏡？試解釋原因。</p><p>(b) 求 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span>。</p><p>X</p><p>(c) <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的像在哪裏出現？ <sup>L</sup></p><p>圖 a 20 cm</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/48dcf277e71107c39cb8cd36.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:270.6px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/20067bf3f1f6242554f7ddd4.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:41.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 因為光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span> 通過透鏡後偏離主軸，所以 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是凹透鏡。</p><p>(b) 如圖 b 所示，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 40 cm</p><p>(c) 假設物體 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 置於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點（圖 c）。</p><p>∴ <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">X</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的像（在位置 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>′）與 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 相距 24 cm。</p><p>圖 b 圖 c</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/5372e0b78f32f1a62a358434.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:299.0px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/853819435fe49ea734e24059.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:302.1px\"/></p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":33,"kind":"question","box":[54.83430090332031,210.33498339843754,565.2833009033203,422.6514434814453],"text":"例 題 8 以一條光線找出像和焦點的位置\r\n在圖 a 中，光線 s 通過焦距為 f 的透鏡 L 後折射。\r\nX 是放在透鏡主軸上的一個點物體。\r\n(a) L 是哪種透鏡？試解釋原因。\r\n(b) 求 f。\r\n(c) X 的像在哪裏出現？\r\n"},{"page":33,"kind":"answer","box":[54.83430090332031,422.6514434814453,565.2833009033203,748.0099833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 因為光線 s 通過透鏡後偏離主軸，所以 L 是凹透鏡。\r\n(b) 如圖 b 所示，f = 40 cm\r\n(c) 假設物體 AB 置於 X 點（圖 c）。\r\n\t∴ X 的像（在位置 B′）與 L 相距 24 cm。\r\nL\r\ns\r\nX\r\nf\r\nr\r\n20 cm\r\n焦平面\r\n② 出射線看似\r\n從焦平面上某\r\n點發散出來\r\n 繪畫光線 ，\r\n它必須與光線 \r\n平行並穿光心\r\ns\r\n① r\r\n圖 b\r\nL\r\nB′\r\nA′\r\nA\r\nB\r\nX\r\n20 cm\r\n \r\nX 和 是同一點，\r\n因此它們的像也在\r\n同一位置形成\r\nB\r\n圖 c\r\nL\r\ns\r\nX\r\n圖 a 20 cm\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-9":{"id":"ex-3A03-9","chapter":"3A03","number":9,"title":"外接廣角鏡頭","question":"<p>圖 a 顯示一個可安裝在手機的外接廣角鏡頭。希兒研究鏡頭的構造時察覺內有一塊透鏡 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span>，然後她用手機拍攝兩張附近大廈的照片，一張使用廣角鏡頭拍攝（圖 b)，另一張則除去廣角鏡頭拍攝（圖 c）。</p><p>(a) 廣角鏡頭所用的是哪一種透鏡？解釋你的答案。</p><p>(b) 希兒直接透過廣角鏡頭觀看物體。圖 d 中，<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 代表一個物體，置於廣角鏡的透鏡 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 前方，光線 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span> 來自 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span> 點，穿過 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span> 後進入希兒的眼睛。</p><p>(i) 找出 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AB</annotation></semantics></math></span> 的像在哪裏出現，並標示它為 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span>′<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span>′。</p><p>(ii) 找出透鏡兩個焦點的位置。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/f254fd0a99876d26b42e1c69.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:540.6px\"/></p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/a103d794f612512057d54eb5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:411.4px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) 由於像是正立和縮小的，因此所用的是凹透鏡。</p><p>(b) (i)，(ii)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/figures-chn/077f3158e1f2a19312eafbfc.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:362.2px\"/></p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>① 根據規則 3，畫出從 A 發出的光線。② 把光線 p 向後延長。③ 交點是 A′，然後用虛線箭嘴畫出 A′B′。④ 為確定 F′ 的位置，根據規則 1，畫出從 A 發出的光線。射出的光線像從 A′ 發出，並與主軸相交於 F′。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":34,"kind":"question","box":[183.2833009033203,56.33398339843757,560.2833009033203,539.6430511474609],"text":"例 題 9 外接廣角鏡頭\r\n圖 a 顯示一個可安裝在手機的外接廣角鏡頭。希兒研究鏡頭的構造時\r\n察覺內有一塊透鏡 L，然後她用手機拍攝兩張附近大廈的照片，一張\r\n使用廣角鏡頭拍攝（圖 b)，另一張則除去廣角鏡頭拍攝（圖 c）。\r\n圖 a 圖 b 圖 c\r\n(a) 廣角鏡頭所用的是哪一種透鏡？解釋你的答案。\r\n(b) 希兒直接透過廣角鏡頭觀看物體。圖 d 中，AB 代表一個物體，置\r\n於廣角鏡的透鏡 L 前方，光線 p 來自 A 點，穿過 L 後進入希兒的\r\n眼睛。\r\nB\r\nL\r\np\r\nA\r\n希兒\r\n主軸\r\n(i) 找出 AB 的像在哪裏出現，並標示它為 A′B′。\r\n(ii) 找出透鏡兩個焦點的位置。\r\n"},{"page":34,"kind":"answer","box":[183.2833009033203,539.6430511474609,560.2833009033203,762.2149833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 由於像是正立和縮小的，因此所用的是凹透鏡。\r\n(b) (i)，(ii)\r\nB F′ B′ F\r\nA′\r\nL\r\np\r\nA\r\n②\r\n①\r\n③\r\n④ 希兒\r\n主軸\r\n"},{"page":34,"kind":"tips","box":[40,52.33398339843757,179.2833009033203,762.2149833984375],"text":"提提你\r\n① 應用成像規則3，繪畫一\r\n條來自 A 的光線。\r\n② 把光線 p 向後延長。\r\n③ 兩條線的相交點是 A′，\r\n用帶箭號的虛線繪畫\r\nA′B′。\r\n④ 要 找 出 F ′ 的 位 置，須\r\n根據成像規則1繪畫一\r\n條來自 A 的光線。這光\r\n線通過透鏡後看似來自\r\nA′，並與主軸相交於 F ′。\r\n影片\r\n 這影片展示一個安裝了平\r\n面鏡和透鏡的錢箱。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-10":{"id":"ex-3A03-10","chapter":"3A03","number":10,"title":"透鏡公式","question":"<p>凸透鏡的焦距是 10 cm，在它前方 15 cm 處放了一個物體。</p><p>(a) 求像距。像是實像還是虛像？</p><p>(b) 如果以焦距相同的凹透鏡取代凸透鏡，像距是多少？像是實像還是虛像？</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{10}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = 30 cm 由於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是正數，像是實像。</p><p>(b) 根據 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{u}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{f}</annotation></semantics></math></span>，</p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>15</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{15}</annotation></semantics></math></span> + <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{-10}</annotation></semantics></math></span></p><p><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> = –6 cm 由於 <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span> 是負數，像是虛像。</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>凹透鏡的 f 為負值。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":37,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,379.0219833984375,565.2833009033203,509.3379669189453],"text":"例 題 10 透鏡公式\r\n凸透鏡的焦距是 10 cm，在它前方 15 cm 處放了一個物體。\r\n(a) 求像距。像是實像還是虛像？\r\n(b) 如果以焦距相同的凹透鏡取代凸透鏡，像距是多少？像是實像還\r\n是虛像？\r\n"},{"page":37,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,509.3379669189453,565.2833009033203,747.8749833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 根據 1\r\nu\r\n + \r\n1\r\nv = 1\r\nf\r\n，\r\n1\r\n15 + \r\n1\r\nv = 1\r\n10\r\nv = 30 cm\r\n由於 v 是正數，像是實像。\r\n(b) 根據 1\r\nu\r\n + \r\n1\r\nv = 1\r\nf\r\n，\r\n1\r\n15 + \r\n1\r\nv = 1\r\n–10\r\nv = –6 cm\r\n由於 v 是負數，像是虛像。\r\n"},{"page":37,"kind":"tips","box":[40,375.0219833984375,184.2833009033203,747.8749833984375],"text":"與例題4 (p.99) 的結果相同。\r\n提提你\r\n凹透鏡的 f 取為負值。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-3A03-12":{"id":"ex-3A03-12","chapter":"3A03","number":12,"title":"1/v 對 1/u 的關係線圖","question":"<p>家俊進行實驗 3e 後得出右面的線圖。</p><p>(a) 求透鏡的焦距。</p><p>(b) 家俊改用了焦距較短的透鏡重複實驗，試描繪他所得的線圖。</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/a94991a06b32b275563851f5.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:227.0px\"/></p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 0.04</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>f</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 25 cm</p><p>(b)</p><p class=\"study-figure\"><img src=\"assets/textbook-examples/media/89b689a50ec3841bb88219ab.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:219.8px\"></p>","tips":"<p>技巧</p><p>數學</p><p>線性關係（第 137 頁）</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_3A03_TN_ce(1).pdf","sha256":"9f93acdf182c7e0bfd92b28c507fca9be1d3f22f43b2ba86de2431bf09412002","segments":[{"page":39,"kind":"question","box":[188.2833009033203,377.85298339843746,565.2833009033203,543.4534454345703],"text":"例 題 12 1\r\nv 對 1\r\nu 的關係線圖\r\n家俊進行實驗3e 後得出右面的線圖。\r\n(a) 求透鏡的焦距。\r\n(b) 家俊改用了焦距較短的透鏡重複\r\n實驗，試描繪他所得的線圖。\r\n"},{"page":39,"kind":"answer","box":[188.2833009033203,543.4534454345703,565.2833009033203,759.5929833984375],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 1\r\nf\r\n = 0.04\r\nf = 25 cm\r\n(b) \r\n0\r\n0.04\r\n0.04\r\n1\r\nv\r\n– / cm–1\r\n1\r\nu\r\n– / cm–1\r\n單元練習 3.4 Q2 (p.118)\r\n0\r\n0.04\r\n0.04\r\n1\r\nv\r\n– / cm–1\r\n1\r\nu\r\n– / cm–1\r\n"},{"page":39,"kind":"tips","box":[40,373.85298339843746,184.2833009033203,759.5929833984375],"text":"當 1\r\nv\r\n = 0，1\r\nu\r\n = 1\r\nf\r\n線性關係 p.137\r\n技巧分析\r\n運 算\r\n技巧分析\r\n斜率必然是–1，因此兩條\r\n直線互相平行。\r\nf ↓ ⇒\r\n1\r\nf\r\n↑ ⇒ 截距 ↑\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete source artwork with reviewed Chinese labels and English-aligned text corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips","answer"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}